<view class="add-page">
  <view class="add-title">设备添加</view>
  <view class="add-subtitle">设备上贴有二维码和设备编号，扫码即可添加</view>
  <view class="add-card">
    <view class="add-card-title">扫码添加</view>
    <view class="add-card-desc">扫描设备上的二维码，自动获取设备编号</view>
    <button class="add-scan" bindtap="onScan">扫一扫</button>
  </view>
</view>
